Codex Subagents

This project preserves the source history of y-cruce/codex-plugin-cc,
which derives from OpenAI's codex-plugin-cc. The working tree was
replaced with a smaller Claude Code / Codex-only implementation.

Upstream references:
https://github.com/y-cruce/codex-plugin-cc
https://github.com/openai/codex-plugin-cc
https://github.com/openai/codex

OpenAI Codex app-server protocol types generated from codex-cli 0.153.4
were used as an implementation reference. No generated type bundle,
Claude installation source, credentials, or user conversations are included.
